{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["Speckled — it seems to me: a patch on the crown and the neck. For ויקד ארצה is the bending of the neck and the crown. And it is doubled, for it is like ויפל from the stem נפל. And נקוד — from ויקוד, on account of the crown (קדקד). Just as: עקוד ברגל, on account of ויעקוד את יצחק — binding at the leg." "Remove from there — for your needs." "And it shall be my wage — from here onward, those that will be born."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {0 "Rashbam reads נקוד as related to קדקד (crown of the head) by metathesis; the illustrations are from Genesis 24:26 (ויקד, 'he bowed the head') and Genesis 22:9 (ויעקוד, 'he bound')."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:48.130808885Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}